msgid "What happens if I uninstall the plugin?"
msgstr ""

#: src/ExternalRepositoryManager.php:395
msgid "Uninstalling the plugin will remove the database tables and repository configuration. However, any plugins or themes already installed from private repositories will remain. Updates will no longer be checked."
